---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

const title = 'Modern Guided-Missile Frigates & Destroyers';
const description =
  'In-service and under-construction guided-missile frigate and destroyer classes, compared on displacement, armament, cost, and status.';
---

<Base title={title} description={description}>
  <div class="warships">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1>Modern Guided-Missile Frigates &amp; Destroyers</h1>
      <p class="sub">In-service and under-construction classes. Click any column header to sort (click again to reverse).
      Displacement is full-load in metric tonnes; costs show the figure as reported plus a rough normalization to 2026 US$.
      Data drawn from English Wikipedia class articles.</p>

      <div class="meta">
        <span><b>Last updated:</b> 9 August 2026</span>
        <span><b>Source:</b> English Wikipedia individual ship-class articles</span>
        <span><b>Coverage:</b> 41 in-service &amp; under-construction classes</span>
        <span>Costs &amp; tonnage normalized best-effort — see notes at the bottom.</span>
      </div>

      <div class="controls">
        <div class="seg" id="typeSeg">
          <button data-type="all" class="on">All types</button>
          <button data-type="Destroyer">Destroyers</button>
          <button data-type="Frigate">Frigates</button>
          <button data-type="LCS">LCS</button>
        </div>
        <select id="statusSel">
          <option value="all">Any status</option>
          <option value="service">In service</option>
          <option value="build">Building / planned</option>
          <option value="cancel">Cancelled</option>
        </select>
        <details class="colmenu" id="colMenuWrap">
          <summary>Columns</summary>
          <div class="colmenu-panel">
            <div class="colmenu-list" id="colMenu"></div>
            <button type="button" class="colmenu-all" id="showAll">Show all columns</button>
          </div>
        </details>
        <input type="search" id="q" placeholder="Search class, country, radar…" autocomplete="off" />
        <span class="count" id="count"></span>
      </div>

      <div class="tablewrap">
        <table>
          <thead><tr id="hrow"></tr></thead>
          <tbody id="body"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>

      <footer>
        <h3>Reading the numbers</h3>
        <p><b>Displacement</b> is full-load, in metric tonnes (1 long ton = 1.016 t; 1 short ton = 0.907 t). "Full load"
        is itself imprecise and drifts upward over a class's life, so treat ±5% as noise.
        <b>VLS</b> shows headline tactical launch cells; the sub-note gives the mix (e.g. strike-length Mk&nbsp;41 vs.
        soft-launch CAMM). Ships combining large strike cells with many small self-defence cells (Type&nbsp;26, Sejong) are
        not directly comparable cell-for-cell.</p>
        <p><b>Cost — read with care.</b> The "≈2026 US$bn" column converts the reported figure at approximate current
        exchange rates and adjusts for US inflation from the quoted year. It is order-of-magnitude, <i>not</i>
        procurement-grade. Two big distortions remain: (1) some quotes are <b>program totals</b> that bundle R&amp;D, shore
        infrastructure and spares over a tiny production run — this inflates per-hull figures for the Zumwalt, Hobart and
        Hunter especially; (2) quotes like the Iver Huitfeldt's are <b>hull-only</b>, with weapons/sensors transferred from
        older ships. Values marked <span class="est">*</span> are estimates with no clean sourced figure.</p>
        <p><b>Type labels</b> follow each navy's own designation. Note the "cruiser/destroyer/frigate" line is now largely
        political: China's Type&nbsp;055 (here a destroyer, as China rates it) is classed a cruiser by the US Navy, and
        several "frigates" (Hunter, F126, Type&nbsp;26) out-displace older destroyers.</p>
        <p>Source: individual class articles on <a href="https://en.wikipedia.org">en.wikipedia.org</a>. Figures for the
        Netherlands/Belgium ASW Frigate and the newest Chinese classes (Type&nbsp;054B) are preliminary. Generated as a
        static, self-contained file — no external dependencies.</p>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style is:global>
  .warships{
    --panel:#ffffff; --ink:#14181d; --muted:#5c6773; --line:#e2e6ea;
    --head:#1f2937; --headink:#f8fafc; --zebra:#f3f5f7; --hover:#eef4ff;
    --accent:#2563eb; --ddg:#b4531a; --ffg:#1a7f6b; --lcs:#6d5bd0; --chip:#eef1f4;
    color:var(--ink); font-size:15px; line-height:1.5;
  }
  /* Dark palette follows the site's header toggle (data-theme), not the OS. */
  :root[data-theme="dark"] .warships{
    --panel:#161b22; --ink:#e6edf3; --muted:#9aa7b4; --line:#273040;
    --head:#0b1220; --headink:#e6edf3; --zebra:#141a22; --hover:#17263f;
    --accent:#5b9dff; --ddg:#e08a52; --ffg:#57c9b0; --lcs:#a99bf0; --chip:#1d2733;
  }
  /* Fallback when the theme script hasn't run (JS disabled): honor the OS. */
  @media (prefers-color-scheme:dark){
    :root:not([data-theme]) .warships{
      --panel:#161b22; --ink:#e6edf3; --muted:#9aa7b4; --line:#273040;
      --head:#0b1220; --headink:#e6edf3; --zebra:#141a22; --hover:#17263f;
      --accent:#5b9dff; --ddg:#e08a52; --ffg:#57c9b0; --lcs:#a99bf0; --chip:#1d2733;
    }
  }
  /* Let the wide table use the full viewport instead of the 1140px main column. */
  main:has(.warships){max-width:none;}
  .warships .wrap{max-width:none;margin:0;padding:0;}
  .warships h1{font-size:26px;margin:0 0 6px;letter-spacing:-.01em;}
  .warships .sub{color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 12px;max-width:80ch;}
  .warships .meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:6px 16px;align-items:center;font-size:12.5px;color:var(--muted);
    border-left:3px solid var(--accent);padding:7px 0 7px 12px;margin:0 0 20px;}
  .warships .meta b{color:var(--ink);font-weight:600;}
  .warships .controls{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px 14px;align-items:center;margin:0 0 14px;}
  .warships .seg{display:inline-flex;background:var(--chip);border-radius:9px;padding:3px;gap:2px;}
  .warships .seg button{border:0;background:transparent;color:var(--muted);padding:6px 12px;border-radius:7px;
    font-weight:600;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;}
  .warships .seg button.on{background:var(--panel);color:var(--ink);box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.12);}
  .warships input[type=search]{flex:1 1 220px;min-width:180px;padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius:9px;background:var(--panel);color:var(--ink);font-size:14px;}
  .warships select{padding:8px 10px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;background:var(--panel);
    color:var(--ink);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;}
  .warships .count{color:var(--muted);font-size:13px;margin-left:auto;white-space:nowrap;}
  .warships .colmenu{position:relative;}
  .warships .colmenu>summary{display:inline-block;list-style:none;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;
    padding:8px 12px;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:9px;background:var(--panel);
    color:var(--ink);font-size:13px;font-weight:600;}
  .warships .colmenu>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none;}
  .warships .colmenu>summary::after{content:" ▾";color:var(--muted);}
  .warships .colmenu[open]>summary{border-color:var(--accent);}
  .warships .colmenu-panel{position:absolute;z-index:5;margin-top:6px;min-width:220px;
    background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:10px;
    box-shadow:0 6px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.18);padding:10px;}
  .warships .colmenu-list{display:grid;gap:2px;max-height:320px;overflow:auto;}
  .warships .colmenu-list label{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:5px 6px;
    border-radius:6px;font-size:13px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap;}
  .warships .colmenu-list label:hover{background:var(--hover);}
  .warships .colmenu-list input{accent-color:var(--accent);}
  .warships .colmenu-all{margin-top:8px;width:100%;border:1px solid var(--line);
    background:transparent;color:var(--ink);padding:7px 10px;border-radius:8px;
    font-size:12.5px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;}
  .warships .colmenu-all:hover{background:var(--hover);}
  .warships .tablewrap{overflow-x:auto;border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:12px;background:var(--panel);
    box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.05);}
  .warships table{border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;font-size:13px;white-space:nowrap;}
  .warships thead th{position:sticky;top:0;background:var(--head);color:var(--headink);text-align:left;
    padding:10px 12px;font-weight:600;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;border-bottom:2px solid var(--line);
    z-index:2;}
  .warships thead th:hover{filter:brightness(1.25);}
  .warships thead th .ar{opacity:.35;font-size:10px;margin-left:4px;}
  .warships thead th.sorted .ar{opacity:1;color:var(--accent);}
  .warships th.num,.warships td.num{text-align:right;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;}
  .warships tbody td{padding:9px 12px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);vertical-align:top;}
  .warships tbody tr:nth-child(even){background:var(--zebra);}
  .warships tbody tr:hover{background:var(--hover);}
  .warships .name{font-weight:700;white-space:normal;min-width:150px;}
  .warships .desig{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-weight:500;font-size:11.5px;}
  .warships .type-pill{display:inline-block;padding:2px 8px;border-radius:20px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;
    letter-spacing:.02em;}
  .warships .type-Destroyer{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ddg) 18%,transparent);color:var(--ddg);}
  .warships .type-Frigate{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--ffg) 18%,transparent);color:var(--ffg);}
  .warships .type-LCS{background:color-mix(in srgb,var(--lcs) 20%,transparent);color:var(--lcs);}
  .warships .wrapcell{white-space:normal;min-width:190px;color:var(--muted);}
  .warships .vnote{display:block;color:var(--muted);font-size:11px;white-space:normal;max-width:170px;}
  .warships .est{color:var(--accent);}
  .warships .status{white-space:normal;min-width:120px;}
  .warships .dot{display:inline-block;width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;margin-right:5px;vertical-align:middle;}
  .warships .s-service{background:#22a06b;} .warships .s-build{background:#e0a800;} .warships .s-cancel{background:#d1495b;}
  .warships footer{color:var(--muted);font-size:12.5px;margin-top:22px;line-height:1.65;max-width:100ch;}
  .warships footer h3{color:var(--ink);font-size:14px;margin:18px 0 6px;}
  .warships footer code{background:var(--chip);padding:1px 5px;border-radius:4px;}
  .warships a{color:var(--accent);}
</style>

